{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-10-25 19:54:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCES 30 PERCENT INCREASE IN REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA , OCT. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE:ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES\xa0COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.13 PER SHARE PAYABLE DECEMBER 9, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 10, 2022, REPRESENTING A 30 PERCENT INCREASE IN THE REGULAR DIVIDEND.\xa0 "ROLLINS HAS A LONG-STANDING TRACK RECORD OF INCREASING OUR DIVIDEND AS WE GROW OUR BUSINESS," COMMENTED MR.'}